(290, 13, 'ai', '⚠️ Belum ada *Villa* sewa di *Malang* saat ini. Berikut pilihan terdekat di kota lain:\n\n1. *Lhokseumawe Main Road Villa Sale*\n   ![Lhokseumawe Main Road Villa Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/villa.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Main Road, Lhokseumawe, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 74.800.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Villa — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 580 m2, tanah 600 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Garden, Private Pool, Wi-Fi, Parking, BBQ Area\n\n2. *Banda Aceh Residential Area Villa Sale*\n   ![Banda Aceh Residential Area Villa Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/villa.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Residential Area, Banda Aceh, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 38.600.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Villa — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 530 m2, tanah 1270 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Kitchen, Security, Parking, AC, Private Pool\n\n3. *Meulaboh Business District Villa Sale*\n   ![Meulaboh Business District Villa Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/villa.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Business District, Meulaboh, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 36.450.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Villa — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 240 m2, tanah 955 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: BBQ Area, Parking, AC, Kitchen, Security\n\n4. *Sabang City Center Villa Sale*\n   ![Sabang City Center Villa Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/villa.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: City Center, Sabang, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 18.400.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Villa — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 710 m2, tanah 735 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Private Pool, AC, Garden, Parking, BBQ Area\n\n5. *Langsa Near Station Villa Sale*\n   ![Langsa Near Station Villa Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/villa.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Near Station, Langsa, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 53.700.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Villa — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 790 m2, tanah 170 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Garden, Kitchen, Parking, Security, Wi-Fi\n\n6. *Lhokseumawe Suburban Area Villa Sale*\n   ![Lhokseumawe Suburban Area Villa Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/villa.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Suburban Area, Lhokseumawe, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 7.750.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Villa — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 290 m2, tanah 750 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: BBQ Area, Parking, AC, Private Pool, Security\n\n\nKami siap membantu Anda menemukan rumah, villa, apartemen, atau properti lainnya yang cocok untuk Anda.\nApakah ada yang ingin Anda tanyakan lebih lanjut?\n\n\nSalam hangat,\n*LEO FELIX*\n*Elevan Property*', 'whatsapp', '{\"aiProvider\":\"private_agent\",\"contextSource\":\"flat_json\"}', '2026-06-05 06:30:35', '2026-06-05 06:30:35'),
