(292, 13, 'ai', 'Berikut pilihan *Beli Rumah Aceh harga 400 juta* yang tersedia dari katalog kami:\n\n1. *Langsa Near Station House Sale*\n   ![Langsa Near Station House Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/house.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Near Station, Langsa, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 68.600.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Rumah — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 310 m2, tanah 280 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Garden, Furnished, Storage Room, Security, Kitchen\n\n2. *Lhokseumawe Suburban Area House Sale*\n   ![Lhokseumawe Suburban Area House Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/house.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Suburban Area, Lhokseumawe, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 32.800.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Rumah — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 390 m2, tanah 535 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Storage Room, Garden, Kitchen, Security, Water Heater\n\n3. *Banda Aceh Industrial Area House Sale*\n   ![Banda Aceh Industrial Area House Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/house.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Industrial Area, Banda Aceh, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 49.900.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Rumah — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 255 m2, tanah 155 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Security, Storage Room, AC, Kitchen, Furnished\n\n4. *Meulaboh Tourism Area House Sale*\n   ![Meulaboh Tourism Area House Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/house.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Tourism Area, Meulaboh, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 65.250.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Rumah — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 360 m2, tanah 160 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Furnished, Water Heater, Kitchen, Garden, Security\n\n5. *Sabang Near Mall House Sale*\n   ![Sabang Near Mall House Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/house.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Near Mall, Sabang, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 16.100.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Rumah — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 285 m2, tanah 455 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: Kitchen, Water Heater, AC, Garden, Security\n\n6. *Langsa Near Campus House Sale*\n   ![Langsa Near Campus House Sale](/assets/image_data/properties/house.png)\n   📍 Lokasi: Near Campus, Langsa, Aceh\n   💰 Harga: *Rp 56.700.000.000*\n   🏠 Tipe: Rumah — Dijual\n   📐 Luas: bangunan 370 m2, tanah 570 m2\n   🏷️ Fasilitas: AC, Garden, Carport, Security, Kitchen\n\n\nKami siap membantu Anda menemukan rumah, villa, apartemen, atau properti lainnya yang cocok untuk Anda.\nApakah ada yang ingin Anda tanyakan lebih lanjut?\n\n\nOmong-omong, rencananya masuk atau pindah bulan apa? 📅\n\nSalam hangat,\n*LEO FELIX*\n*Elevan Property*', 'whatsapp', '{\"aiProvider\":\"private_agent\",\"contextSource\":\"flat_json\"}', '2026-06-05 06:48:35', '2026-06-05 06:48:35'),
